-- an automorphism of a molecule with its configurations: an automorphism of the graph that carries each
-- atom's arrangement to the arrangement at the atom it is sent to. Equality here is equality in Cyc, so
-- a relabelling that reverses an arrangement is not one of these, which is the whole content.
StAuto : Stereo → Type 0
StAuto C = (a : Auto (st-mol C)) × ((x : mol-atoms (st-mol C)) → cyc-map (mol-atoms (st-mol C)) (mol-atoms (st-mol C)) (auto-fun (st-mol C) a) (st-arr C x) ≡ st-arr C (auto-fun (st-mol C) a x))
